{
  "name": "racket-capnp",
  "description": "A nascent implementation of the Cap'n Proto serialization protocol for the Racket language, focused on providing efficient, zero-copy data interchange. It implements low-level primitives for word-aligned memory management, pointer-based data traversal, and untyped message access. The project serves as an exploratory foundation for bridging Racket-based capability systems like Spritely Goblins with the Cap'n Proto RPC ecosystem.",
